> M1_THICK_HIDE	Has a thick hide or scales (ex: crocodile)
> 
> What effect does it have in the game?  Does a monster being thick scaled 
> have some sort of effect on resistance rolls?  I'm writing a 
> spoiler/article on this and help would be appreciated.  Thanks.

This has to do with damage done by bullwhips.  Attacking a thick
skinned creature with a bullwhip negates normal damage done by a whip
(1d2 vs. small, 1 vs. large) and any enchantment bonus.  Also, martial
arts stunning blows do not affect thick skinned monsters.  For full
details, grep thick_skinned uhitm.c...

